WEBVTT

00:00:02.530 --> 00:00:04.950
A free Mac battery meter that shows more.

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:06.680
A real reading:

00:00:06.910 --> 00:00:07.550
percent,

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:08.310
an arrow,

00:00:08.410 --> 00:00:09.140
and watts.

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:10.710
A sample.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:13.310
The arrow points down while it drains.

00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:15.250
Another sample.

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:17.890
Orange at 20 percent or below.

00:00:18.710 --> 00:00:20.300
The menu adds time left,

00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:21.750
volts,

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:22.700
adapter, and cycles.

00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:26.160
It also lists the apps using the most power.

00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:27.200
Quit one,

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:29.230
or force quit it after a prompt.

00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:31.290
Hide Apple's icon,

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:33.960
then hold Command and drag BatteryMeter in.

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:36.660
Free for Apple silicon Macs.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:37.790
No email,

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:38.760
no account.

